&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you have experience with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows Server (High Availability Clustering)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows Server Active Directory Domain Services&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
